WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.460 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 10=

5
01:39.780 --> 01:41.780
There was a farmer who lived in the mountains of Lingnan.

6
01:42.540 --> 01:44.260
He was short and weak,

7
01:45.260 --> 01:47.260
and farmed a few small plots alone.

8
01:49.020 --> 01:49.580
One day,

9
01:49.820 --> 01:51.820
some villagers came running in a panic.

10
01:52.980 --> 01:54.220
They told him they had often spotted

11
01:55.060 --> 01:56.460
a giant python nearby,

12
01:57.580 --> 02:00.340
over three zhang, covered in bright scales.

13
02:00.940 --> 02:02.780
And it'd devoured many travelers and horses.

14
02:03.940 --> 02:06.020
They urged him to move elsewhere.

15
02:06.820 --> 02:07.700
But he said nothing.

16
02:09.580 --> 02:12.460
Did he have a secret way to kill the python?

17
02:14.860 --> 02:16.140
After hearing about it,

18
02:16.620 --> 02:18.820
he spent day and night pondering how to kill it.

19
02:20.020 --> 02:22.180
They said it moved like the wind.

20
02:22.740 --> 02:24.460
Even a galloping horse couldn't outrun it.

21
02:25.100 --> 02:26.420
Its body was covered in hard scales,

22
02:26.820 --> 02:27.620
impervious to attacks.

23
02:30.140 --> 02:31.860
Victory seemed impossible.

24
02:32.260 --> 02:33.260
The villagers might not even survive.

25
02:34.780 --> 02:35.380
And then?

26
02:36.060 --> 02:37.820
He kept racking his brains

27
02:38.220 --> 02:39.660
but never found a solution.

28
02:40.340 --> 02:41.460
He simply farmed every day,

29
02:41.980 --> 02:43.940
working at sunrise and returning at sunset.

30
02:44.700 --> 02:45.460
Until one day,

31
02:47.540 --> 02:48.980
after harvesting all his rice,

32
02:49.900 --> 02:52.500
he was so exhausted that he fell asleep on a field ridge.

33
02:53.700 --> 02:54.900
When he finally awoke,

34
02:55.300 --> 02:56.260
he found the python

35
02:57.420 --> 02:59.020
had already swallowed both his legs.

36
03:01.660 --> 03:02.780
When a python catches live prey,

37
03:03.500 --> 03:05.180
it usually constricts it to death first.

38
03:06.460 --> 03:07.460
But he'd been fast asleep,

39
03:07.820 --> 03:08.980
so the python took him for dead

40
03:09.740 --> 03:10.940
and slowly swallowed him.

41
03:12.380 --> 03:13.740
Then how did he survive?

42
03:15.060 --> 03:16.500
How do you know he survived?

43
03:17.220 --> 03:18.580
Or who else would be telling the story?

44
03:18.900 --> 03:19.540
The python?

45
03:21.940 --> 03:22.540
Until then,

46
03:22.860 --> 03:23.900
he'd pondered day and night

47
03:24.580 --> 03:26.180
but couldn't figure out what to do.

48
03:26.780 --> 03:27.460
Then,

49
03:28.300 --> 03:30.900
just as the python had swallowed him up to the waist,

50
03:31.740 --> 03:32.700
he suddenly sat up

51
03:33.620 --> 03:34.780
and snapped its spine.

52
03:35.420 --> 03:36.540
He grabbed the sickle beside him,

53
03:36.860 --> 03:37.980
thrust it into the snake's mouth,

54
03:39.340 --> 03:40.540
and slit its throat.

55
03:40.860 --> 03:41.740
So he killed the python?

56
03:46.340 --> 03:48.220
One year, I went hunting with my brother

57
03:48.820 --> 03:49.780
and we passed his thatched cottage.

58
03:50.860 --> 03:52.300
He was already an old man by then.

59
03:53.020 --> 03:54.300
He told us the story himself.

60
03:55.820 --> 03:56.500
The snake's skin

61
03:57.340 --> 03:58.140
hung on his wall.

62
04:00.140 --> 04:00.820
So, Your Highness,

63
04:01.700 --> 04:03.660
there's no need to worry or rush.

64
04:04.500 --> 04:05.660
Since we're outmatched

65
04:06.300 --> 04:07.020
and can't fight back,

66
04:07.900 --> 04:09.100
let's wait and see.

67
04:10.140 --> 04:11.380
Even if we do nothing,

68
04:12.260 --> 04:13.060
that python

69
04:13.780 --> 04:15.900
will eventually expose its vulnerable throat.

70
04:16.860 --> 04:17.900
There's only one thing

71
04:19.100 --> 04:19.780
you need to do:

72
04:20.660 --> 04:21.260
Wait.

73
04:23.660 --> 04:24.140
And perhaps

74
04:24.980 --> 04:26.460
endure.

75
04:27.700 --> 04:29.980
Even with the python swallowing your legs,

76
04:31.420 --> 04:32.860
you must act as if nothing's wrong.

77
04:33.340 --> 04:33.860
Pretend

78
04:34.540 --> 04:35.500
you're still fast asleep.

79
04:40.700 --> 04:41.420
I see.

80
04:44.020 --> 04:44.500
Yan Shang.

81
04:45.060 --> 04:46.340
You're still quite the storyteller.

82
04:57.180 --> 04:57.580
Let's go.

83
04:58.500 --> 05:00.540
This house won't be ready until tomorrow.

84
05:01.020 --> 05:02.060
No one can stay here tonight.

85
05:12.940 --> 05:14.020
So that residence

86
05:14.340 --> 05:15.860
is linked to yours by waterways,

87
05:16.300 --> 05:17.420
and the gates face each other in a maze?

88
05:18.860 --> 05:19.980
After going around in circles,

89
05:20.220 --> 05:21.580
I could barely tell where I was.

90
05:21.740 --> 05:22.580
Walk around a few more times,

91
05:22.740 --> 05:23.500
and you'll get the hang of it.

92
05:24.380 --> 05:28.220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

93
05:50.140 --> 05:51.700
What brings you here so late?

94
05:53.060 --> 05:54.020
I need to talk to you.

95
05:55.700 --> 05:56.300
It's so late.

96
05:56.740 --> 05:57.500
Why is he still here?

97
05:58.940 --> 05:59.700
What's it to you?

98
06:02.860 --> 06:03.380
You may go back.

99
06:05.460 --> 06:05.740
Wait.

100
06:07.380 --> 06:09.340
Why the rush, Mr. Yan?

101
06:11.340 --> 06:12.580
I'll be frank with you, Mr. Yang.

102
06:13.140 --> 06:14.620
I'm now Her Highness's male favorite,

103
06:14.980 --> 06:16.020
and she pays me a monthly stipend.

104
06:16.580 --> 06:18.420
I must obey Her Highness's orders.

105
06:19.260 --> 06:20.220
So I can't stay.

106
06:20.580 --> 06:20.940
You...

107
06:28.900 --> 06:29.660
Aren't you going back?

108
06:30.180 --> 06:30.940
How many times must I tell you?

109
06:31.700 --> 06:32.660
The imperial exam is just days away.

110
06:33.260 --> 06:34.540
Aren't you studying tonight?

111
06:35.260 --> 06:35.580
Got it.

112
06:44.420 --> 06:45.420
Do you even know this man?

113
06:45.700 --> 06:46.500
And you're letting him stay here?

114
06:47.740 --> 06:48.700
I hired him for his looks.

115
06:50.020 --> 06:51.140
Why should it matter

116
06:51.500 --> 06:52.340
whether I know him?

117
06:53.380 --> 06:55.060
I'm just afraid he'll take you for a ride.

118
06:56.340 --> 06:58.060
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Yang.

119
07:03.100 --> 07:03.460
Wanyao,

120
07:05.220 --> 07:06.140
who were you protecting

121
07:08.420 --> 07:09.140
with that lie today?

122
07:12.780 --> 07:13.740
Did the Crown Prince tell you?

123
07:14.460 --> 07:15.500
Answer me, Wanyao.

124
07:15.740 --> 07:16.780
I can't.

125
07:18.340 --> 07:18.780
Yang Si.

126
07:19.820 --> 07:20.700
I can only tell you one thing.

127
07:21.580 --> 07:22.180
Before,

128
07:22.900 --> 07:24.740
I couldn't protect those I wanted to.

129
07:25.700 --> 07:27.780
But now I can, so I did.

130
07:37.500 --> 07:38.500
If I'm right,

131
07:39.940 --> 07:41.380
court investigators will take over

132
07:41.860 --> 07:43.380
Zhang Renjing's murder case tomorrow.

133
07:44.900 --> 07:46.460
You won't be able to pursue it anymore.

134
07:47.340 --> 07:47.940
So,

135
07:48.620 --> 07:49.500
will you still interrogate me?

136
07:54.140 --> 07:55.540
Go ahead and protect those you want to.

137
07:57.420 --> 07:58.140
I'll protect you.

138
08:00.500 --> 08:01.140
That works for me.

139
08:07.460 --> 08:07.900
Yang Si!

140
08:11.900 --> 08:13.180
Come to my residence tomorrow.

141
08:13.620 --> 08:15.820
I'll borrow your carriage to see the Crown Prince.

142
08:18.540 --> 08:21.700
(Chongli Hall)

143
08:27.580 --> 08:28.020
What's the matter?

144
08:30.180 --> 08:30.580
Your Royal Highness,

145
08:31.180 --> 08:31.940
Princess Danyang is here.

146
08:41.060 --> 08:41.460
Wanyao,

147
08:42.780 --> 08:43.820
why didn't you tell me beforehand

148
08:44.620 --> 08:45.700
you were bringing a stranger?

149
08:46.300 --> 08:46.660
Xun,

150
08:47.220 --> 08:47.940
this is Yan Shang.

151
08:48.580 --> 08:50.140
He's the real killer of Zhang Renjing.

152
08:54.580 --> 08:55.380
Greetings, Your Royal Highness.

153
08:56.220 --> 08:57.340
This isn't the Court of Judicial Review.

154
08:58.380 --> 08:59.300
Guilty or innocent,

155
08:59.900 --> 09:00.500
I don't care.

156
09:15.180 --> 09:16.500
Yan Shang came to Sheng'an

157
09:17.500 --> 09:18.340
with no rank,

158
09:18.660 --> 09:19.420
no possessions.

159
09:20.060 --> 09:21.340
He used Grand Princess Luling

160
09:21.460 --> 09:22.660
and the Peony Festival

161
09:23.100 --> 09:24.980
to plot Zhang Renjing's murder.

162
09:26.100 --> 09:27.820
He's now living at my residence

163
09:28.420 --> 09:29.420
and serving as my adviser.

164
09:30.620 --> 09:33.140
He'll help you with your plans from now on.

165
09:34.860 --> 09:36.420
I'm grateful for Her Highness's trust.

166
09:36.940 --> 09:38.860
I'll serve Your Royal Highness with all my heart.

167
09:40.460 --> 09:42.140
A man of courage and cunning,

168
09:42.820 --> 09:44.420
I truly admire you.

169
09:53.660 --> 09:55.940
Since I've decided to join you in our great cause,

170
09:56.300 --> 09:57.260
there are no secrets between us.

171
09:58.420 --> 09:59.460
Those at my side

172
10:00.060 --> 10:00.980
are at yours as well.

173
10:05.180 --> 10:05.540
Wanyao,

174
10:06.380 --> 10:06.940
I'll drink to you.

175
10:08.060 --> 10:08.780
Between us,

176
10:09.220 --> 10:10.220
there should be such honesty.

177
10:37.820 --> 10:39.100
You little brat, what's so funny?

178
10:40.460 --> 10:41.700
I'm happy for you.

179
10:42.300 --> 10:43.860
You got your money's worth with this house.

180
10:52.180 --> 10:52.860
Yan Shang!

181
10:53.220 --> 10:53.940
Chunhua!

182
10:54.900 --> 10:55.700
Don't call him.

183
10:56.780 --> 10:57.700
Let him study in peace.

184
11:54.540 --> 11:55.580
Wei Shu, why the daydreaming?

185
11:57.340 --> 11:58.020
I was wondering

186
11:58.620 --> 12:00.140
how much sulfur to use.

187
12:01.380 --> 12:02.900
Stop thinking about such nonsense.

188
12:03.060 --> 12:04.340
The exam's in two days,

189
12:04.340 --> 12:05.380
yet you haven't opened a book.

190
12:07.780 --> 12:08.460
Then...

191
12:09.740 --> 12:10.940
what should I read?

192
12:14.060 --> 12:14.380
Fine.

193
12:15.260 --> 12:16.140
Figure it out yourself.

194
12:16.420 --> 12:17.420
I'll be up all night studying.

195
12:40.740 --> 12:41.940
Your imperial exams are tomorrow.

196
12:42.340 --> 12:42.940
Are you nervous?

197
12:44.900 --> 12:45.340
Forget it.

198
12:45.900 --> 12:47.140
You'd never admit it anyway.

199
12:50.180 --> 12:51.500
That's not why I came here.

200
12:52.260 --> 12:53.220
Whether I pass or fail,

201
12:53.780 --> 12:54.380
it doesn't matter.

202
12:55.180 --> 12:55.860
Doesn't matter?

203
12:57.020 --> 12:58.740
Then how do you plan to make a living in Sheng'an?

204
13:02.900 --> 13:05.060
By being your male favorite, of course.

205
13:06.580 --> 13:07.420
I'm not arguing with you.

206
13:13.140 --> 13:14.060
Are you free tonight?

207
13:15.660 --> 13:16.020
Why?

208
13:16.900 --> 13:18.020
I'm hosting a dinner at my residence.

209
13:18.380 --> 13:19.380
I'd like you and Wei Shu to join me.

210
13:21.060 --> 13:21.700
What a shame.

211
13:22.380 --> 13:23.740
I have plans tonight.

212
13:27.020 --> 13:29.380
Your Highness, I went to see Wei Shu.

213
13:29.580 --> 13:31.380
He said he had plans and couldn't come.

214
13:36.780 --> 13:43.680
(Moonlight Pavilion)

215
13:46.340 --> 13:47.660
The moon is bright tonight,

216
13:47.940 --> 13:48.620
but sadly, not quite full.

217
13:49.540 --> 13:52.020
Liu Wenji, don't say such ill-omened things.

218
13:53.020 --> 13:53.740
In tomorrow's exam,

219
13:54.020 --> 13:55.580
all four of us will enjoy full success!

220
13:57.460 --> 13:58.940
Yes. My mistake.

221
13:59.700 --> 14:00.380
(Moonlight Pavilion) It's all Yan Shang's fault!

222
14:00.740 --> 14:02.300
He's always busy with who knows what.

223
14:02.700 --> 14:04.620
Only today did he introduce me to you all.

224
14:06.700 --> 14:07.620
It's just as well the moon isn't full.

225
14:08.140 --> 14:08.860
For what waxes must wane.

226
14:09.340 --> 14:10.180
Liu Wenji. Feng Xianyu.

227
14:10.940 --> 14:11.380
Not quite.

228
14:11.820 --> 14:14.180
Waxing and waning are just appearances.

229
14:14.940 --> 14:15.500
The moon itself

230
14:16.180 --> 14:17.180
has never changed.

231
14:19.620 --> 14:19.980
Wei Shu,

232
14:20.820 --> 14:21.340
I don't get it.

233
14:23.100 --> 14:25.260
Liu Wenji, that's for the best.

234
14:26.020 --> 14:27.660
If Wei Shu starts explaining,

235
14:27.980 --> 14:29.420
none of us can sleep tonight.

236
14:34.260 --> 14:35.060
Are you asleep, Yan Shang?

237
14:37.460 --> 14:38.660
I'm listening to you all talk.

238
14:39.140 --> 14:40.340
It feels so peaceful.

239
14:41.180 --> 14:42.020
Life is short.

240
14:42.660 --> 14:44.740
The moon was like this generations ago.

241
14:45.260 --> 14:46.060
And generations later,

242
14:46.540 --> 14:47.740
it will still look the same.

243
14:48.660 --> 14:50.620
But we'll all be dust by then.

244
14:51.180 --> 14:52.380
Yet tonight, we're here,

245
14:52.700 --> 14:54.860
sharing tea and admiring the moon.

246
14:55.420 --> 14:57.300
Isn't that wonderful?

247
14:59.860 --> 15:00.260
Indeed.

248
15:01.020 --> 15:02.100
It's truly wonderful!

249
15:03.820 --> 15:05.700
Wenji was my only friend before.

250
15:06.420 --> 15:07.740
Now, in Sheng'an, I've met all of you.

251
15:08.260 --> 15:08.780
When I think about it,

252
15:09.860 --> 15:10.700
I'm truly lucky.

253
15:13.140 --> 15:13.820
My dear friends,

254
15:14.660 --> 15:17.060
I never had friends before either.

255
15:19.620 --> 15:20.380
When we part tonight,

256
15:20.820 --> 15:21.900
whatever fate has in store for us,

257
15:22.300 --> 15:24.220
I hope we'll be friends for life.

258
15:24.780 --> 15:25.060
Come on!

259
15:25.580 --> 15:25.860
Cheers!

260
15:41.380 --> 15:45.020
(Examination Hall)

261
15:52.420 --> 15:57.220
(Examination Hall)

262
16:01.900 --> 16:02.260
Thank you.

263
16:07.860 --> 16:08.460
(Examination Hall) (Let's go, Wei Shu.)

264
16:16.620 --> 16:20.380
(Examination Hall)

265
16:20.380 --> 16:20.780
(My lady!)

266
16:24.540 --> 16:28.860
(Examination Hall)

267
16:28.860 --> 16:33.820
(Half a month later)

268
16:48.620 --> 16:49.060
What's wrong?

269
16:50.060 --> 16:50.980
You bet on all the wrong candidates?

270
16:53.060 --> 16:53.820
Want to see?

271
16:54.860 --> 16:55.700
Let's see

272
16:56.060 --> 16:57.020
what rank you got.

273
16:58.980 --> 16:59.780
I'm an examinee.

274
17:00.140 --> 17:01.140
I shouldn't look at this.

275
17:02.020 --> 17:03.140
Besides, before the results are announced,

276
17:03.700 --> 17:04.940
not a single name on this list

277
17:05.460 --> 17:06.340
is set in stone.

278
17:08.420 --> 17:08.980
True.

279
17:09.620 --> 17:11.740
These rankings are based on the exam alone.

280
17:12.340 --> 17:13.500
No one's tampered with them yet.

281
17:14.740 --> 17:15.860
Now that the list is out,

282
17:16.340 --> 17:17.900
who knows how many hands it'll pass through?

283
17:18.860 --> 17:20.580
Everyone will want to rig the rankings.

284
17:21.380 --> 17:22.580
By the time the results are announced,

285
17:23.700 --> 17:25.380
who knows what the list will look like?

286
17:32.780 --> 17:33.460
(Still...)

287
17:33.820 --> 17:35.100
(my luck with these bets)

288
17:36.100 --> 17:36.940
(is almost too good.)

289
17:36.940 --> 17:42.180
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing, 3rd: Yan Shang)

290
17:46.500 --> 17:47.660
You're in a good mood.

291
17:48.020 --> 17:49.140
Has someone on this list

292
17:49.140 --> 17:50.740
caught your eye?

293
17:50.740 --> 17:51.980
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing, 3rd: Yan Shang)

294
17:51.980 --> 17:53.180
I'd be unhappy if they had.

295
17:53.860 --> 17:55.300
It's more fun when they haven't.

296
17:56.100 --> 17:56.660
When they haven't?

297
17:58.580 --> 17:59.340
I've recently spotted

298
17:59.740 --> 18:01.420
a promising young man.

299
18:02.300 --> 18:03.220
He's got some backbone,

300
18:04.020 --> 18:04.660
but not much.

301
18:06.380 --> 18:08.020
All he needs is this piece of paper.

302
18:11.780 --> 18:14.220
But you've already taken in so many men.

303
18:18.780 --> 18:19.220
I see.

304
18:20.180 --> 18:21.100
They're all mediocre now.

305
18:21.420 --> 18:22.620
Not worth your attention.

306
18:34.100 --> 18:35.060
Go to the Imperial Academy

307
18:35.340 --> 18:36.460
and summon Feng Xianyu.

308
18:38.220 --> 18:39.340
Tell him...

309
18:41.620 --> 18:44.460
(3rd: Yan Shang)

310
18:45.500 --> 18:46.100
Tell him

311
18:47.060 --> 18:48.980
I'll make him the third place.

312
18:50.700 --> 18:51.060
Understood.

313
18:56.460 --> 19:01.380
(Grand Princess Luling's Residence)

314
19:36.020 --> 19:40.900
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing, 3rd: Yan Shang)

315
19:45.820 --> 19:49.340
(3rd: Yan Shang)

316
20:05.380 --> 20:07.020
Please help me, Your Highness.

317
20:09.620 --> 20:12.600
(Writing and Ink)

318
20:17.660 --> 20:19.100
(After I'm gone...)

319
20:19.260 --> 20:20.580
(Cao Miaozhen, Feng Xianyu's wife)

320
20:20.580 --> 20:21.500
(our daughter...)

321
20:22.740 --> 20:25.380
(will have only you to rely on...)

322
20:35.740 --> 20:37.620
May you...

323
20:39.220 --> 20:43.300
take the top spot...

324
20:44.660 --> 20:45.260
Miaozhen!

325
20:45.540 --> 20:46.380
I did it...

326
20:49.660 --> 20:50.740
I did it...

327
20:52.220 --> 20:53.420
I did it!

328
20:56.060 --> 20:58.220
I did it!

329
21:04.700 --> 21:07.180
(I did it!)

330
21:26.180 --> 21:27.020
It's only been half a day,

331
21:28.220 --> 21:30.580
and the names have changed several times.

332
21:31.220 --> 21:33.300
No matter how gifted you are,

333
21:33.940 --> 21:35.140
without powerful backing,

334
21:36.020 --> 21:37.660
you're just duckweed adrift.

335
21:38.740 --> 21:39.860
You drift through Sheng'an,

336
21:40.460 --> 21:41.100
and just like that,

337
21:41.500 --> 21:42.460
you're gone.

338
21:45.980 --> 21:48.420
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing, 3rd: Feng Xianyu)

339
21:50.260 --> 21:51.500
(3rd: Feng Xianyu)

340
21:52.860 --> 21:54.780
Wasn't the original third place...

341
21:54.980 --> 21:55.700
It was Wanyao's male favorite,

342
21:56.620 --> 21:57.740
Yan Shang from Lingnan.

343
21:58.500 --> 21:59.460
What good is passing the exam?

344
22:00.300 --> 22:01.700
Wanyao can barely protect herself.

345
22:02.540 --> 22:03.700
How could she protect anyone else?

346
22:04.540 --> 22:06.100
One word from Grand Princess Luling,

347
22:06.700 --> 22:08.100
and his name was struck off.

348
22:12.380 --> 22:12.900
Still...

349
22:15.100 --> 22:17.020
who am I to mock her?

350
22:18.220 --> 22:19.820
As long as Yu Cheng'an is around,

351
22:21.620 --> 22:23.500
I'm in no position to feel safe either.

352
22:29.340 --> 22:30.540
Your Highness, Mr. Yang is here.

353
22:32.060 --> 22:33.380
Why did the Crown Prince send you here?

354
22:33.500 --> 22:34.660
Am I only here because he sent me?

355
22:35.220 --> 22:35.980
Can't we meet

356
22:36.140 --> 22:37.500
for our own reasons?

357
22:39.180 --> 22:40.180
All right.

358
22:40.460 --> 22:41.540
What brings you here, then?

359
22:42.620 --> 22:43.940
Yan Shang is no longer the third place.

360
22:46.780 --> 22:47.340
Who did it?

361
22:48.540 --> 22:49.220
Grand Princess Luling

362
22:49.220 --> 22:50.460
struck his name off herself,

363
22:51.340 --> 22:52.540
and replaced it with Feng Xianyu.

364
22:53.340 --> 22:55.460
I hear he's her latest favorite.

365
23:01.380 --> 23:02.260
Thanks for telling me.

366
23:04.340 --> 23:05.780
Should I thank Yan Shang, then?

367
23:06.100 --> 23:07.940
He's given me an excuse to see you.

368
23:08.300 --> 23:09.500
Enough with the sarcasm.

369
23:10.020 --> 23:11.340
Since when did you get so sharp-tongued?

370
23:12.980 --> 23:13.380
That's enough.

371
23:13.700 --> 23:14.140
I'm leaving.

372
23:20.540 --> 23:21.220
She holds considerable power.

373
23:22.140 --> 23:23.220
Don't confront her head-on.

374
23:23.540 --> 23:24.060
Yang Si,

375
23:24.700 --> 23:25.620
I'm not a fool.

376
23:26.860 --> 23:27.580
Yan Shang alone

377
23:28.180 --> 23:29.740
isn't worth offending Grand Princess Luling.

378
23:33.820 --> 23:34.500
Besides,

379
23:36.020 --> 23:37.060
given my position,

380
23:38.180 --> 23:38.940
even if I wanted to,

381
23:41.060 --> 23:42.020
what could I do to her?

382
23:51.780 --> 23:54.020
(Calligraphy)

383
24:13.300 --> 24:13.700
Your Highness.

384
24:14.780 --> 24:15.660
Don't stop on my account.

385
24:15.860 --> 24:16.540
Keep writing.

386
24:17.500 --> 24:18.500
I just came to have a look.

387
24:29.140 --> 24:31.260
(Calligraphy)

388
24:38.740 --> 24:40.220
Back in Lingnan,

389
24:41.300 --> 24:43.420
I was so scared of bugs I couldn't sleep.

390
24:44.740 --> 24:45.580
I'd run out

391
24:46.660 --> 24:47.740
and find you writing in the courtyard.

392
24:48.580 --> 24:49.700
I was amazed back then.

393
24:50.540 --> 24:51.900
In such a remote village,

394
24:52.700 --> 24:54.700
someone could actually read and write.

395
24:55.900 --> 24:57.380
That was quite a feat.

396
24:57.380 --> 24:58.460
(Calligraphy)

397
25:06.220 --> 25:06.660
Have you come

398
25:07.340 --> 25:08.980
with news about the exam?

399
25:10.820 --> 25:11.780
Why would it be about the exam?

400
25:12.140 --> 25:13.180
The results come out tomorrow.

401
25:14.020 --> 25:14.820
At a time like this,

402
25:15.260 --> 25:17.380
if you rush over looking so hesitant,

403
25:18.140 --> 25:19.300
it can only be about that.

404
25:23.060 --> 25:23.980
Did I fail?

405
25:30.100 --> 25:30.540
Then...

406
25:31.420 --> 25:32.740
my name must've been replaced.

407
25:37.700 --> 25:38.140
It's all right.

408
25:39.700 --> 25:41.380
I didn't come to Sheng'an for the exam.

409
25:42.540 --> 25:43.980
Even as your adviser,

410
25:44.340 --> 25:45.660
I don't need to make the list.

411
25:47.300 --> 25:47.660
Your Highness,

412
25:48.380 --> 25:49.020
you don't need to

413
25:49.940 --> 25:50.660
comfort me.

414
25:53.780 --> 25:54.220
Yan Shang,

415
25:54.660 --> 25:56.020
do you know why you failed?

416
25:57.220 --> 25:58.980
Your classmate Feng Xianyu

417
25:58.980 --> 26:00.140
went to Grand Princess Luling.

418
26:00.300 --> 26:01.100
One word from her,

419
26:01.660 --> 26:02.660
and he became the third place!

420
26:05.820 --> 26:06.700
I'm no match for her.

421
26:07.300 --> 26:08.300
So you had to fail!

422
26:20.740 --> 26:21.180
Your Highness.

423
26:23.580 --> 26:24.300
Don't take it to heart.

424
26:25.020 --> 26:25.820
Don't be sad.

425
26:26.340 --> 26:27.500
You've done more than enough for me.

426
26:28.100 --> 26:28.860
If you're feeling hurt,

427
26:29.540 --> 26:30.220
or angry about this,

428
26:31.100 --> 26:32.580
I can walk around the courtyard with you

429
26:33.180 --> 26:33.740
to help you clear your head.

430
26:34.100 --> 26:34.860
I'm not upset!

431
26:35.380 --> 26:36.180
Why would I be?

432
26:37.260 --> 26:37.700
Why would I need comfort

433
26:37.700 --> 26:38.980
from an exam failure like you?

434
26:44.580 --> 26:45.620
Your Highness, wait!

435
26:46.180 --> 26:46.580
Your Highness!

436
26:46.820 --> 26:47.340
How dare you!

437
26:48.260 --> 26:48.820
Where are you going?

438
26:49.180 --> 26:50.700
Do I have to report my every move to you?

439
26:50.940 --> 26:51.580
Are you going to the palace,

440
26:52.180 --> 26:53.220
or Grand Princess Luling's residence?

441
26:54.060 --> 26:54.540
Or...

442
26:55.660 --> 26:56.660
are you going to see Yu Cheng'an?

443
26:56.820 --> 26:58.220
I'll go wherever I please.

444
26:58.820 --> 26:59.460
What's it to you?

445
27:00.740 --> 27:01.140
Your Highness,

446
27:02.340 --> 27:03.180
in Sheng'an,

447
27:03.780 --> 27:04.780
nothing comes for free.

448
27:05.540 --> 27:07.060
Everything has a price.

449
27:08.180 --> 27:09.020
I'm not worth the sacrifice.

450
27:09.780 --> 27:10.220
Yan Shang,

451
27:11.780 --> 27:12.660
don't tell me what to do.

452
27:13.540 --> 27:14.780
You don't get to decide what's worth it.

453
27:16.860 --> 27:18.940
They wronged me, not you.

454
27:19.900 --> 27:20.700
All these years,

455
27:21.100 --> 27:22.700
I've backed down time and again.

456
27:23.540 --> 27:25.340
After Lingnan, I made up my mind.

457
27:26.300 --> 27:27.900
I refuse to live like this anymore!

458
27:28.940 --> 27:29.820
Listen carefully.

459
27:30.340 --> 27:31.820
You're mine now.

460
27:32.900 --> 27:35.020
We'll share both honor and disgrace.

461
27:36.460 --> 27:38.460
But if you have no rank or title,

462
27:39.460 --> 27:40.300
how can you help me?

463
27:40.740 --> 27:41.740
How will you survive in Sheng'an?

464
27:42.060 --> 27:42.820
What good are you to me?

465
27:46.180 --> 27:47.340
Ten years of hard study,

466
27:48.820 --> 27:49.700
all for an empty dream.

467
27:51.300 --> 27:51.900
Yan Shang,

468
27:53.420 --> 27:55.020
don't tell me you're content with this.

469
27:59.780 --> 28:04.420
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

470
28:04.620 --> 28:07.140
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

471
28:07.300 --> 28:10.820
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

472
28:10.940 --> 28:11.420
Your Highness...

473
28:11.420 --> 28:13.820
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

474
28:13.820 --> 28:14.540
Does this...

475
28:14.540 --> 28:16.940
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

476
28:16.940 --> 28:18.020
... really have to be settled?

477
28:18.220 --> 28:18.540
Yes!

478
28:18.540 --> 28:20.540
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

479
28:20.620 --> 28:21.340
Do you remember...

480
28:21.340 --> 28:22.740
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

481
28:22.740 --> 28:24.060
... the story I told about the giant python

482
28:24.940 --> 28:26.460
when we first came here?

483
28:28.280 --> 28:29.580
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

484
28:29.580 --> 28:30.020
Your Highness,

485
28:31.540 --> 28:33.180
we're still waiting for the python

486
28:33.940 --> 28:34.940
to expose its throat.

487
28:36.660 --> 28:39.220
If we anger the Grand Princess, Yu Cheng'an will catch wind of it.

488
28:40.820 --> 28:41.660
It's not time yet.

489
28:42.420 --> 28:45.420
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

490
28:45.420 --> 28:46.060
Please, endure this a little longer.

491
28:46.340 --> 28:49.420
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

492
28:49.660 --> 28:55.860
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

493
28:55.860 --> 28:57.220
We'll find another way

494
28:58.660 --> 28:59.980
without alerting the python.

495
29:07.020 --> 29:08.500
There is indeed another way.

496
29:08.500 --> 29:11.060
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

497
29:11.060 --> 29:12.740
Whoever started it must end it.

498
29:12.740 --> 29:16.580
♪A scar for a scar♪

499
29:16.580 --> 29:19.900
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

500
29:24.260 --> 29:24.900
- (Yan Shang.) - (Yan Shang.)

501
29:25.860 --> 29:26.180
(Yan Shang.)

502
29:26.700 --> 29:27.020
(Yan Shang.)

503
29:27.300 --> 29:27.660
(Yan Shang.)

504
29:30.540 --> 29:30.980
(Yan Shang.)

505
29:38.860 --> 29:39.220
Yan Shang.

506
29:40.220 --> 29:40.580
Wei Shu.

507
29:41.260 --> 29:42.460
Have you seen Feng Xianyu today?

508
29:42.820 --> 29:43.860
I've searched everywhere for him.

509
29:44.980 --> 29:45.860
You're too late.

510
29:46.340 --> 29:47.580
He's seeing someone off outside the south gate.

511
29:48.020 --> 29:49.260
He left a quarter of an hour ago.

512
29:50.260 --> 29:50.660
Thank you.

513
29:54.180 --> 29:54.580
How did it go?

514
29:55.060 --> 29:55.380
Let's go.

515
29:56.180 --> 29:56.740
To the south gate!

516
29:57.740 --> 30:00.780
(Imperial Academy)

517
30:07.540 --> 30:08.500
(Mingde Gate) When you get home,

518
30:09.500 --> 30:10.820
take care of the old house and farmland.

519
30:12.100 --> 30:13.340
And find someone to raise Guiniang well.

520
30:13.740 --> 30:15.500
(Guiniang, Feng Xianyu's daughter) Give her a good life from now on.

521
30:16.260 --> 30:17.340
I'll send money home every month.

522
30:20.100 --> 30:20.460
Farewell.

523
30:32.900 --> 30:33.780
Father!

524
30:35.980 --> 30:37.100
Father, don't go!

525
30:37.820 --> 30:39.140
I'll behave!

526
30:40.540 --> 30:42.900
Father, don't leave me!

527
30:53.780 --> 30:54.340
(Father...)

528
30:54.340 --> 30:55.220
Shall we follow Mr. Feng?

529
30:57.740 --> 30:57.980
No.

530
30:58.860 --> 30:59.660
Go after the old servant.

531
31:00.700 --> 31:00.980
(Got it.)

532
31:09.740 --> 31:10.060
Sir,

533
31:10.500 --> 31:10.820
please wait.

534
31:18.380 --> 31:18.980
Who are you?

535
31:19.340 --> 31:20.420
I'm Feng Xianyu's classmate.

536
31:21.220 --> 31:22.780
This must be his little girl.

537
31:23.580 --> 31:24.340
I believe we've met once.

538
31:26.140 --> 31:27.740
It's getting dark. Where are you going?

539
31:28.420 --> 31:29.020
I have a carriage.

540
31:29.580 --> 31:31.020
Let me give you a ride.

541
31:32.180 --> 31:33.380
Thank you for your kindness, sir.

542
31:34.300 --> 31:35.140
It's too far.

543
31:35.660 --> 31:36.380
You can't take us all the way.

544
31:36.980 --> 31:38.460
We are heading home

545
31:38.740 --> 31:40.380
(Feng family's old servant) to Luzhou.

546
31:42.180 --> 31:43.260
You were doing just fine.

547
31:43.820 --> 31:44.820
Why leave so suddenly?

548
31:46.380 --> 31:47.340
Who knows?

549
31:47.860 --> 31:48.620
To be honest,

550
31:49.220 --> 31:50.180
my master

551
31:50.660 --> 31:51.220
has spent years

552
31:51.860 --> 31:53.060
taking the exams in Sheng'an.

553
31:54.060 --> 31:55.060
The family's savings

554
31:55.780 --> 31:56.380
are all gone.

555
31:57.260 --> 31:58.900
His wife just passed away.

556
32:00.460 --> 32:01.820
And now his little girl

557
32:02.420 --> 32:03.860
is going home with an old man like me.

558
32:04.900 --> 32:06.820
Who knows how we'll get by?

559
32:11.340 --> 32:11.620
Sir,

560
32:12.500 --> 32:13.540
please wait.

561
32:16.740 --> 32:17.100
Fang Tong,

562
32:17.900 --> 32:18.900
did you bring any money?

563
32:19.420 --> 32:20.260
Could you lend me some?

564
32:37.300 --> 32:37.900
Don't forget to pay me back.

565
32:38.460 --> 32:38.860
Of course.

566
32:40.220 --> 32:41.660
What good will a few coins do?

567
32:43.300 --> 32:43.660
Here, take this.

568
32:54.580 --> 32:54.940
Thank you!

569
33:02.100 --> 33:02.380
Sir.

570
33:02.380 --> 33:03.260
Oh...

571
33:04.500 --> 33:05.100
This little sum

572
33:05.580 --> 33:06.260
is to cover your travel expenses.

573
33:06.700 --> 33:07.820
With an old man and a little girl

574
33:08.260 --> 33:08.860
traveling so far after dark,

575
33:09.140 --> 33:09.860
please take extra care.

576
33:11.260 --> 33:11.620
Take it.

577
33:15.500 --> 33:17.180
Keep this money safe.

578
33:17.660 --> 33:18.740
Don't let anyone see it.

579
33:19.260 --> 33:20.860
When you get home, buy a few more acres.

580
33:21.260 --> 33:21.620
That way,

581
33:22.180 --> 33:22.780
you can support yourselves.

582
33:24.100 --> 33:25.460
No, we can't accept this!

583
33:26.500 --> 33:26.940
Sir,

584
33:27.700 --> 33:29.660
we're strangers to you.

585
33:30.220 --> 33:30.500
This...

586
33:30.740 --> 33:31.660
You've misunderstood, sir.

587
33:32.060 --> 33:33.100
I'm Feng Xianyu's friend.

588
33:35.780 --> 33:36.260
Please take it.

589
33:40.980 --> 33:41.300
Guiniang,

590
33:41.780 --> 33:42.900
go on, thank this gentleman.

591
33:42.980 --> 33:44.620
Thank you, sir.

592
33:49.580 --> 33:50.020
Guiniang,

593
33:51.580 --> 33:52.900
you have quite a few flowers in your hair.

594
33:53.740 --> 33:55.140
Can I have one?

595
33:55.860 --> 33:56.460
Sure.

596
34:01.540 --> 34:02.260
Thank you, Guiniang.

597
34:08.500 --> 34:10.060
Why take a flower from a little girl?

598
34:11.180 --> 34:11.620
Your Highness,

599
34:12.420 --> 34:13.420
you should go home now.

600
34:16.900 --> 34:18.100
You're off to do something wicked,

601
34:18.380 --> 34:19.140
and I shouldn't watch?

602
34:20.740 --> 34:21.700
Best not to watch.

603
34:22.660 --> 34:24.700
It can't be worse than murder, can it?

604
34:25.820 --> 34:27.340
If you kill Feng Xianyu on the spot,

605
34:27.820 --> 34:28.500
first,

606
34:28.700 --> 34:30.420
I'll cheer you on.

607
34:30.900 --> 34:31.300
Second,

608
34:31.660 --> 34:32.780
I can help cover it up, can't I?

609
34:33.940 --> 34:36.020
Anyway, we've done this before.

610
34:38.060 --> 34:38.380
Let's go.

611
34:38.780 --> 34:39.500
Find Feng Xianyu.

612
34:40.820 --> 34:43.140
(Silk Road Pavilion)

613
34:43.140 --> 34:43.460
Your Highness.

614
34:44.940 --> 34:45.500
(This way.)

615
34:45.500 --> 34:45.820
(This place...)

616
34:46.700 --> 34:47.580
(Cuiyun Tower) (Careful.)

617
34:47.940 --> 34:48.380
(Careful, sir.)

618
34:48.380 --> 34:50.300
Move. It's not a den of tigers.

619
34:50.580 --> 34:51.460
(Take care!)

620
34:52.540 --> 34:54.180
Ma'am, please wait.

621
34:54.540 --> 34:57.260
Wh-what brings you here?

622
34:57.420 --> 34:58.580
Not me.

623
34:59.300 --> 35:00.340
My husband wanted to come.

624
35:03.860 --> 35:04.220
That's right.

625
35:04.820 --> 35:05.660
It was my own idea to come.

626
35:07.540 --> 35:08.820
Well...

627
35:09.140 --> 35:10.540
Are you going in with him?

628
35:11.300 --> 35:11.820
Of course.

629
35:12.740 --> 35:14.340
My husband wants to visit a brothel.

630
35:14.740 --> 35:16.140
So naturally, I'll keep an eye on him.

631
35:16.980 --> 35:17.300
Move aside.

632
35:17.340 --> 35:20.020
(Cuiyun Tower)

633
35:20.020 --> 35:22.220
(Well, I've seen it all now!)

634
35:25.420 --> 35:25.820
(Sir!)

635
35:27.980 --> 35:28.500
(Bravo!)

636
35:30.180 --> 35:30.660
(Bravo!)

637
35:31.580 --> 35:32.140
(Careful.)

638
35:34.660 --> 35:35.300
(Let's go!)

639
35:39.260 --> 35:41.420
Have you been here before?

640
35:42.620 --> 35:42.980
I have.

641
35:44.180 --> 35:44.660
That day,

642
35:44.980 --> 35:47.260
Wei Shu and I followed Feng Xianyu here.

643
35:47.780 --> 35:48.260
(Come on!)

644
35:48.580 --> 35:50.900
That Feng guy really is a scoundrel!

645
36:06.300 --> 36:07.140
(Bravo!)

646
36:07.700 --> 36:08.900
(Bravo!)

647
36:13.460 --> 36:15.500
(Bravo!)

648
36:17.300 --> 36:17.660
Thank you.

649
36:31.580 --> 36:32.140
Feng Xianyu,

650
36:33.180 --> 36:34.020
you're drunk

651
36:34.780 --> 36:35.540
and don't even recognize me?

652
36:37.780 --> 36:38.500
Of course I do.

653
36:40.180 --> 36:41.020
I'll take my leave.

654
36:43.780 --> 36:45.060
Feng Xianyu, why the rush?

655
36:46.620 --> 36:48.140
I've come to congratulate you.

656
36:50.860 --> 36:51.860
You're joking, Yan Shang.

657
36:52.940 --> 36:53.900
What's there to celebrate?

658
36:54.140 --> 36:55.580
You've taken the third place.

659
36:56.500 --> 36:57.740
Isn't that worth celebrating?

660
37:04.100 --> 37:05.580
You're here to demand justice?

661
37:08.500 --> 37:09.940
You know better than I do.

662
37:11.300 --> 37:12.740
Justice and fairness

663
37:13.620 --> 37:14.900
lie in the hearts.

664
37:15.220 --> 37:15.700
Yan Shang,

665
37:17.820 --> 37:18.900
say what you came to say.

666
37:19.980 --> 37:21.300
Stop pretending!

667
37:26.540 --> 37:28.140
If I said it here,

668
37:29.260 --> 37:29.780
Feng Xianyu,

669
37:30.580 --> 37:32.340
your reputation would be ruined.

670
38:01.820 --> 38:03.300
(Bravo!)

671
38:28.260 --> 38:28.940
Yan Shang,

672
38:30.340 --> 38:31.420
cut the act.

673
38:34.020 --> 38:35.220
You think my hands are dirty.

674
38:35.900 --> 38:36.900
But are yours clean?

675
38:38.340 --> 38:39.420
I rely on the powerful.

676
38:40.540 --> 38:41.860
But are you any more above reproach?

677
38:42.500 --> 38:43.620
I knew what was on the list.

678
38:44.220 --> 38:45.020
And so did you.

679
38:45.020 --> 38:46.460
Why else would you accuse me?

680
38:48.300 --> 38:50.100
You have Princess Danyang backing you.

681
38:50.380 --> 38:51.300
But who do I have?

682
38:54.700 --> 38:55.340
Feng Xianyu,

683
38:56.580 --> 38:57.980
you must've gone to great lengths

684
38:59.060 --> 39:00.140
to get that place, right?

685
39:05.660 --> 39:06.260
It doesn't matter.

686
39:12.820 --> 39:14.580
I don't care at all.

687
39:15.620 --> 39:16.700
Once the results are posted tomorrow,

688
39:17.420 --> 39:18.900
you'll be nothing.

689
39:24.140 --> 39:25.420
I used to think

690
39:26.900 --> 39:27.900
we were friends.

691
39:28.220 --> 39:29.780
And you came here to say this?

692
39:30.180 --> 39:31.780
Did you ever consider me a friend?

693
39:35.140 --> 39:35.580
Feng Xianyu,

694
39:37.220 --> 39:38.100
not everyone

695
39:38.700 --> 39:40.580
cares that much about making the list,

696
39:41.460 --> 39:42.340
more than friendship,

697
39:43.260 --> 39:43.900
and more than

698
39:44.820 --> 39:46.820
their own flesh and blood.

699
39:50.100 --> 39:50.700
Guiniang!

700
39:51.620 --> 39:52.540
What have you done to her?

701
39:53.980 --> 39:54.860
Do you still care about her?

702
39:56.940 --> 39:57.380
Yan Shang!

703
39:58.340 --> 39:59.580
If you have a problem, come at me!

704
40:00.180 --> 40:01.060
If you lay a finger on her,

705
40:01.740 --> 40:03.140
I'll haunt you to my dying day!

706
40:07.940 --> 40:08.460
Relax.

707
40:09.540 --> 40:10.740
Your daughter and the old servant

708
40:11.340 --> 40:12.380
are both safe for now.

709
40:13.260 --> 40:15.260
I've merely invited them to stay the night.

710
40:22.100 --> 40:22.780
However,

711
40:24.180 --> 40:25.020
after tonight,

712
40:25.620 --> 40:26.860
when the results are posted tomorrow,

713
40:27.740 --> 40:28.860
her safety will depend

714
40:29.780 --> 40:31.220
on what her father

715
40:32.700 --> 40:33.460
decides to do.

716
40:41.820 --> 40:43.020
You monster!

717
40:48.460 --> 40:50.260
Some fool got in my way

718
40:51.340 --> 40:52.580
and nearly broke my foot!

719
40:53.620 --> 40:54.100
Are you all right?

720
40:55.300 --> 40:55.900
I'm only teasing you.

721
40:59.100 --> 41:00.220
Princess Danyang

722
41:00.500 --> 41:01.540
is a little more mischievous

723
41:01.980 --> 41:03.060
than Grand Princess Luling.

724
41:04.260 --> 41:05.500
Forgive me, Feng Xianyu.

725
41:05.740 --> 41:06.020
Come on.

726
41:16.820 --> 41:17.300
Feng Xianyu,

727
41:18.420 --> 41:20.380
the results won't be posted for ten hours.

728
41:21.860 --> 41:22.780
You still have time

729
41:23.140 --> 41:24.900
to give back what you stole.

730
41:25.500 --> 41:26.020
Then

731
41:26.540 --> 41:27.500
we'll call it even,

732
41:28.820 --> 41:30.380
and Guiniang will be safe.

733
41:35.820 --> 41:36.260
Farewell.

734
41:46.700 --> 41:48.980
If I hadn't seen that girl leave myself,

735
41:49.300 --> 41:50.060
I'd have bought it.

736
41:52.420 --> 41:54.220
Do you think this is despicable?

737
41:54.980 --> 41:55.860
Not despicable.

738
41:56.860 --> 41:57.980
That's strategy.

739
41:59.020 --> 42:01.540
Especially against a shameless scoundrel like him,

740
42:02.300 --> 42:03.860
why should we play fair?

741
42:05.580 --> 42:08.300
But what if he doesn't care about his daughter's life

742
42:08.820 --> 42:10.300
and turns out to be a complete beast?

743
42:11.300 --> 42:11.860
What then?

744
42:13.580 --> 42:14.660
Then I'll tell him

745
42:14.980 --> 42:16.460
I'll write down everything he's done

746
42:16.860 --> 42:18.820
and have it spread across Sheng'an.

747
42:19.420 --> 42:20.780
His disgrace will go down in history

748
42:21.340 --> 42:23.340
and be gossiped about for generations.

749
42:23.900 --> 42:24.660
He's a scholar.

750
42:25.140 --> 42:26.780
A lifetime of failure or disgrace for generations,

751
42:27.260 --> 42:28.020
he knows which is worse.

752
42:29.500 --> 42:30.660
How devious.

753
42:31.660 --> 42:32.260
What a brilliant plan.

754
42:34.300 --> 42:35.620
By fair means or foul,

755
42:35.940 --> 42:36.940
we can only do what we can.

756
42:37.780 --> 42:38.980
Whether we succeed or fail tomorrow

757
42:39.700 --> 42:40.300
is up to fate.

758
42:43.860 --> 42:44.380
(Excuse me.)

759
42:46.500 --> 42:47.020
(Let me through.)

760
42:47.020 --> 42:47.340
(What's going on?)

761
42:48.660 --> 42:50.780
Cuiyun Tower's really packed tonight.

762
42:54.060 --> 42:54.580
Cover for me.

763
43:01.700 --> 43:02.100
Stop right there!

764
43:07.140 --> 43:08.020
What are you doing here?

765
43:08.260 --> 43:08.780
Mr. Yang,

766
43:09.260 --> 43:10.060
it's been a while.

767
43:10.620 --> 43:11.820
Don't get chummy with me.

768
43:15.820 --> 43:16.660
You dare come to a place like this?

769
43:18.220 --> 43:19.500
You're here too, aren't you?

770
43:21.820 --> 43:22.300
Yan Shang,

771
43:23.020 --> 43:24.780
you dare seduce the Princess

772
43:24.780 --> 43:26.820
while sneaking off to brothels behind her back?

773
43:27.100 --> 43:27.940
Have you no shame?

774
43:29.900 --> 43:31.500
Does coming here mean visiting courtesans?

775
43:31.940 --> 43:32.700
Then, are you here

776
43:33.220 --> 43:34.420
to visit courtesans too?

777
43:37.620 --> 43:39.100
I owe you no explanation!

778
43:48.940 --> 43:50.820
You've got a woman hanging on you right now.

779
43:51.300 --> 43:52.140
Still denying it?

780
43:54.020 --> 43:54.500
What do we do?

781
43:56.900 --> 43:58.380
You're still flirting!

782
43:59.260 --> 44:00.660
You shameless scoundrel!

783
44:02.220 --> 44:02.660
What?

784
44:03.580 --> 44:06.260
Are you going to report me to the Princess?

785
44:10.100 --> 44:11.100
What's the point?

786
44:12.460 --> 44:14.100
You have already bewitched her.

787
44:14.740 --> 44:15.740
She'd only get upset!

788
44:17.020 --> 44:19.020
Then thanks for keeping my secret.

789
44:20.740 --> 44:21.180
Until next time.

790
44:54.180 --> 44:58.900
(Next Episode Preview)

791
44:58.900 --> 45:01.860
(Third-Ranked Scholar, do you have a wife back home?)

792
45:02.500 --> 45:03.220
Your Majesty,

793
45:03.860 --> 45:04.340
I do not.

794
45:05.420 --> 45:06.140
What do you think

795
45:06.740 --> 45:08.360
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

796
45:14.600 --> 45:17.893
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

797
45:20.578 --> 45:25.494
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

798
45:27.688 --> 45:33.533
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

799
45:34.033 --> 45:39.259
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

800
45:42.028 --> 45:46.819
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

801
45:47.655 --> 45:53.734
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

802
45:55.535 --> 45:58.685
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

803
45:58.685 --> 46:00.333
♪Burning bright as a song♪

804
46:00.385 --> 46:04.109
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

805
46:04.487 --> 46:09.153
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

806
46:09.772 --> 46:13.813
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

807
46:14.304 --> 46:16.419
♪Not a single hour less♪

808
46:16.459 --> 46:23.405
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

809
46:24.168 --> 46:27.621
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

810
46:27.801 --> 46:30.946
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

811
46:31.385 --> 46:38.022
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

812
46:38.419 --> 46:40.457
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

813
46:40.457 --> 46:42.933
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

814
46:42.971 --> 46:45.440
♪You're the only one I need♪

815
46:45.644 --> 46:52.531
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

816
46:52.843 --> 46:56.114
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

817
46:56.419 --> 46:59.592
♪My last untouched innocence♪

818
46:59.916 --> 47:03.342
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

819
47:03.575 --> 47:06.800
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

820
47:07.131 --> 47:13.927
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

821
47:14.296 --> 47:16.358
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

822
47:16.359 --> 47:18.862
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

823
47:18.909 --> 47:21.247
♪You're the only one I need♪

824
47:21.478 --> 47:28.313
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

825
47:28.662 --> 47:30.280
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

826
47:30.410 --> 47:32.206
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

827
47:32.563 --> 47:35.580
♪You're the only one I need♪

828
47:35.620 --> 47:36.947
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
